<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄβαξ</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰκος</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>slab, board</i>: </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>reckoning-board,</i> used for counting votes, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				69.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>board</i> sprinkled with sand or dust for drawing geometrical
			diagrams, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				9.282
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Protr.</u>
				34
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>VP</u>
				5.22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>dice-board,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Caryst.
				3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>sideboard,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ammon.
				<u>Diff.</u>
				1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>trencher, plate,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
				86
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>BCH</u>
				29.510
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in Lat. form <i>abacus, slab</i> on capital
			of column, <i><span class="en">
				Vitr.
				3.5.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>marble wall-slab,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				7.3.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀβακής.</span>
			
		</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
